{"4992860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "New Home", "steam_appid": 4992860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Home is an anomaly and liminal-like short horror game centered around simple yet unpredictable challenges and sudden bizarre occurrences. Doors leading to odd places and supernatural events appear in every room of the house; beware of the anomalies and find a way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thoroughly explore the constantly changing environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New pieces of furniture will appear as you walk through the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/41b658af8e81cfcacc83d7accb31eb91.poster.avif?t=1787932429\" aria-label=\"Changing Environment\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/41b658af8e81cfcacc83d7accb31eb91.webm?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/41b658af8e81cfcacc83d7accb31eb91.mp4?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of strange anomalies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong inside your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/95fd522ce6cbc28ce0561f6039452daa.poster.avif?t=1787932429\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/95fd522ce6cbc28ce0561f6039452daa.webm?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/95fd522ce6cbc28ce0561f6039452daa.mp4?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your way out of various places.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors will take you to locations beyond worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/a5bad1df1dff616775fb263cbd86a1e0.poster.avif?t=1787932429\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/a5bad1df1dff616775fb263cbd86a1e0.webm?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/a5bad1df1dff616775fb263cbd86a1e0.mp4?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape from your home.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not safe to stay here; find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/7395c02f94cffe366358d092beea512d.poster.avif?t=1787932429\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992860/extras/7395c02f94cffe366358d092beea512d.webm?t=1787932429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite